##### The Wandering Blade [Bushi]

Starting Skills (choose five): Fitness, Martial Arts [Melee], Martial Arts [Ranged], Martial Arts [Unarmed], Meditation, Performance, Smithing

Techniques Available: Kata (kata), Rituals (ritual), Shūji (shuji)

- Kata (choose one): Striking as Air, Striking as Earth, Striking as Water, Striking as Fire

Signature Weapon (School Ability): Choose a signature weapon category (or unarmed) with GM approval. When using a weapon from this category for an Attack action or Performance check, roll one additional skill die. Additionally, when making such a check you may suffer fatigue up to your school rank to alter that many results of your kept dice to (op) results.

Starting Outfit: Traveling clothes, any one weapon of your signature weapon category of rarity 8 or lower (with GM approval), any two items of rarity 4 or lower, and one trinket (see page 219).

